#==============================================================================================
#
#   navigable_4 - HTML::Navigable: creating navigation params by fetching, and populating a
#   session history entry's document
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/Navigable.cpp lines 1285-1804
#       (create_navigation_params_by_fetching, Navigable::populate_session_history_entry_document).
#       Requests, responses, bodies and the CSP response check are Fetch's (phase 2 closure stubs).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2022-2024, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2023-2025, Aliaksandr Kalenik <kalenik.aliaksandr@gmail.com>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
